1
00:02:08,181 --> 00:02:14,181
It's a merry Muppet Christmas with Fozzie and friends!

2
00:04:16,363 --> 00:04:22,363
A Muppet Family Christmas is a family, comedy,
music film directed by Peter Harris.

3
00:06:24,545 --> 00:06:30,545
Fozzie Bear surprises his mother on Christmas Eve by bringing the
entire Muppet gang to her farm to celebrate the holidays.

4
00:08:32,727 --> 00:08:38,727
Doc and his dog Sprocket, who had planned a quiet Christmas, end up joining
the Muppets in their holiday activities and preparations.

5
00:10:40,909 --> 00:10:46,909
The Sesame Street and Fraggle Rock regulars join the festivities, but to Kermit's dismay,
the only one missing is Miss Piggy, who has been caught in a snowstorm.

6
00:12:49,090 --> 00:12:55,090
Kermit the Frog / Rowlf the Dog / Dr. Teeth / Swedish Chef /
Waldorf / Ernie / Self, played by Jim Henson.

7
00:14:57,272 --> 00:15:03,272
Miss Piggy / Fozzy Bear / Animal / Sam the Eagle / Bert /
Grover / Cookie Monster, played by Frank Oz.

8
00:17:05,454 --> 00:17:11,454
Gonzo / Dr. Bunsen Honeydew / Zoot / Beauregard /
Boober Fraggle, played by Dave Goelz.

9
00:19:13,636 --> 00:19:19,636
Robin the Frog / Camilla the Chicken / Floyd Pepper / Lew Zealand / Pops / The
Count / Gobo Fraggle / Herry Monster, played by Jerry Nelson.

10
00:21:21,818 --> 00:21:27,818
Scooter / Janice / Statler / Beaker / Gladys the Cow / Two-Headed
Monster / Snowman (voice), played by Richard Hunt.

11
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:36,000
Mokey Fraggle (voice), played by Kathryn Mullen.

12
00:25:38,181 --> 00:25:44,181
A Muppet Family Christmas is a Christmas musical
television special starring Jim Henson's Muppets.

13
00:27:46,363 --> 00:27:52,363
It first aired on December 16, 1987, on the ABC
television network in the United States.

14
00:29:54,545 --> 00:30:00,545
Its teleplay was conceived by longtime Muppet writer
Jerry Juhl, and directed by Peter Harris.

15
00:32:02,727 --> 00:32:08,727
This television special was filmed at 9 Channel Nine Court in Toronto, Ontario.

16
00:34:10,909 --> 00:34:16,909
The special features various Muppets from The Muppet Show,
Sesame Street, Fraggle Rock, and Muppet Babies.

17
00:36:19,090 --> 00:36:25,090
It also stars Gerry Parkes as Doc from the North American wraparound segments of
Fraggle Rock, and Henson as himself in a cameo appearance at the end.

18
00:38:27,272 --> 00:38:33,272
In the plot, the Muppets surprise Fozzie Bear's mother with a Christmas visit
to her farmhouse, unaware of her planned getaway to Malibu.

19
00:40:35,454 --> 00:40:41,454
Due to licensing issues with songs featured in A Muppet Family Christmas,
some scenes have been cut from subsequent home media releases.

20
00:42:43,636 --> 00:42:49,636
The film explores themes of holiday, christmas
party, snowstorm, puppet, blizzard.

21
00:44:51,818 --> 00:44:57,818
The tone is lighthearted.
